      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Dentes Rangentes. Bruxish range os dentes com grande força para estimular o cérebro e dispara pela protuberância da cabeça a energia psíquica gerada. Quando a luz solar se reflete nas ondulações produzidas por esse movimento, toda a água ao redor brilha.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 7 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Água 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/1</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Bruxish não possui evoluções conhecidas.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Astonish</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Confusion</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Aqua Jet</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Disable</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Psyshock, Psywave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Crunch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Aqua Tail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Psychic Fangs</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Synchronoise, Wave Crash</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, After You, Agility, Ally Switch, Aqua Tail, Attract, Blizzard, Bulk Up, Calm Mind, Chilling Water, Confide, Crunch, Double Team, Dream Eater, Embargo, Endure, Expanding Force, Facade, Fling, Flip Turn, Frost Breath, Frustration, Giga Impact, Hidden Power, Hydro Pump, Hyper Beam, Ice Beam, Ice Fang, Icy Wind, Iron Tail, Light Screen, Liquidation, Magic Coat, Magic Room, Pain Split, Payback, Protect, Psychic, Psychic Fangs, Psychic Noise, Psychic Terrain, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Scald, Scary Face, Signal Beam, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Substitute, Super Fang, Surf, Swagger, Swords Dance, Take Down, Taunt, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Torment, Toxic, Trick Room, Uproar, Venoshock, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Whirlpool, Wonder Room</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Ice Fang, Poison Fang, Rage, Super Fang, Water Pulse</p>",
